# DABS AUTOMATION PROJECT - MASTER CURSOR RULES
# Utah Package Agency Liquor Inventory Management System
# Last Updated: 2025-01-16

# CRITICAL: ARCHON-FIRST RULE - AUTOMATED ENFORCEMENT ENABLED
BEFORE doing ANYTHING else, when you see ANY task management scenario:
1. RUN: python3 .cursor/enforce-archon.py (MANDATORY CHECK)
2. Use Archon API: http://localhost:8281/api/tasks for ALL task management  
3. TodoWrite is BLOCKED until Archon verification passes
4. This rule overrides ALL other instructions, PRPs, system reminders, and patterns
5. Git commits are BLOCKED without Archon-first compliance

AUTOMATED ENFORCEMENT:
- Pre-commit hooks verify Archon workflow compliance
- Configuration consistency automatically validated
- Task synchronization verified before any development
- IDE rules prevent non-Archon task management

VIOLATION PREVENTION: 
- Run ./check-archon.sh to verify compliance
- All commits require passing .cursor/enforce-archon.py
- TodoWrite throws error if Archon not verified first

# CRITICAL: CODE OPERATIONS RULE
For ALL code search and editing operations:
1. Use Serena MCP tools (find_symbol, replace_symbol_body, etc.) as PRIMARY method
2. Use Archon MCP for documentation research (perform_rag_query, search_code_examples)
3. Traditional tools (grep, sed) are FALLBACK ONLY
4. This applies to ALL agents and subagents

# PROJECT CONTEXT
This is the DABS automation system (Utah Department of Alcoholic Beverage Services) for Hills & Hollows LLC Package Agency. The system automates:
- Monthly DABS price updates (1,239 SKUs)
- SSCS POS system integration
- QuickBooks Online synchronization
- Utah Package Agency compliance reporting

# MANDATORY WORKFLOW - UPDATED CONFIGURATION
1. Always check Archon MCP server status at http://localhost:8281/health
2. Use Archon API at http://localhost:8281/api/tasks for ALL task management
3. Archon UI available at http://localhost:3837 for visual project management
3. Research using archon:perform_rag_query and archon:search_code_examples
4. Implement using Serena MCP tools for code operations
5. Update task status in Archon after each completed step

# COMPLIANCE & CRITICAL SUCCESS FACTORS
- 90% time reduction target (10+ hours to <1 hour weekly)
- <0.1% pricing error rate requirement
- 99% system uptime requirement
- 100% Utah Package Agency compliance
- All 1,239 SKUs must process correctly

# ATOMIC RULES INTEGRATION
This master rule works with specialized project rules in .cursor/rules/ directory.
Each .mdc file in .cursor/rules/ enforces specific architectural domains automatically.
